# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.log

# Editors / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Temporary verification scripts
*-check.mjs
*-check.ts

# AI assistant working memory / tool state (project docs live in plan.md & progress.md).
